WEBVTT

00:00:01.390 --> 00:00:04.980
Satoshi, who aims to battle
the Supreme Monarch, Dande...

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:10.110
And Go, who dreams of catching every Pokémon
to work his way up to Mew...

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:15.290
This is the story of their lives and adventures.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:22.370
Eleboo, use Shock Wave!

00:00:27.450 --> 00:00:28.470
Riolu!

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:31.090
Eleboo! Electro Ball!

00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:35.760
Are you okay?!

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:37.640
You can still do this!
Stand up!

00:00:39.470 --> 00:00:41.140
That’s it, Riolu!
You got this!

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:45.350
Yes! Time to finish it!
100,000 Volts!

00:00:45.350 --> 00:00:46.900
Now! Vacuum Wave!

00:00:54.330 --> 00:00:57.090
Eleboo is unable to battle!
Riolu wins!

00:00:57.090 --> 00:00:59.600
As such, the winner is
Contestant Satoshi!

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:01.230
All right!

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:05.290
You did great, Riolu!

00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:07.440
I can’t believe you beat Eleboo!
Amazing!

00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:12.260
Based on the results of this battle,
the rankings will be updated!

00:01:13.130 --> 00:01:17.110
Current standing in the
Pokémon World Championships rankings:

00:01:17.670 --> 00:01:19.140
901th place.

00:01:19.610 --> 00:01:22.460
It went up! Yeah!

00:01:22.460 --> 00:01:25.130
All right, let’s keep up
the winning streak!

00:01:26.730 --> 00:01:28.090
What’s up, Pikachu?

00:01:30.370 --> 00:01:32.630
You wanna fight next?

00:01:34.220 --> 00:01:35.490
I see you’re real pumped!

00:01:37.140 --> 00:01:40.120
But Riolu’s on a roll right now.

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:42.610
Counting on you for
the next one, too, Riolu!

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:45.320
All right, let’s train some more
when we get home!

00:01:45.980 --> 00:01:47.510
Who should I have you face?

00:01:49.620 --> 00:01:52.560
Kairyu? That’s a tough one!

00:01:53.970 --> 00:02:00.600
PocketMonsters

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:03.020
Hey, you still not ready? C'mon, hurry up!

00:02:03.020 --> 00:02:05.600
You all packed and ready to leave?

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:08.320
I'll show you this wide mysterious world

00:02:08.320 --> 00:02:11.190
And skip the slow send-off

00:02:11.190 --> 00:02:13.530
Be it through fire or through water

00:02:13.530 --> 00:02:16.200
I'm fumbling blindly through the days

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:20.700
When I don't even know what the next second will bring

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:25.960
Each and every one of my memories

00:02:25.960 --> 00:02:30.550
Can always be found inside a Ball

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:34.470
On 1, 2, 3, dive in!

00:02:34.470 --> 00:02:40.220
I've got the future plans I imagined in my pocket

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:47.230
Greeting someone new is always fresh

00:02:47.230 --> 00:02:51.440
No need (No need!) to hesitate! Try! (Try!)

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:52.780
Let's have a fight!

00:02:52.780 --> 00:02:55.490
1: Once the battle's done

00:02:55.490 --> 00:02:57.320
2: And we're laughing or crying

00:02:57.320 --> 00:03:01.660
On 3, let's be friends!

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:08.330
Any day and every day, that's always been my rule

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:13.670
With this unpredictable, boundless world awaiting

00:03:13.670 --> 00:03:16.170
Let's go! Every time you trip and fall

00:03:16.170 --> 00:03:20.300
Let's go! You pick yourself up by my side

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:22.100
I choose you!

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:31.110
Pikachu's Reluctance,

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:37.840
Satoshi is training with Riolu,
excited for his next official battle.

00:03:37.840 --> 00:03:39.360
Kamonegi,
use Crossroad Kill!

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:44.740
Riolu, counter with
Force Palm!

00:03:49.260 --> 00:03:51.100
All right! That’s enough!

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:56.540
You still wanna go on?

00:03:56.970 --> 00:04:00.720
Wanna have Riolu
fight <i>my</i> Kamonegi, then?

00:04:00.720 --> 00:04:01.550
Sounds great!

00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:03.150
Well done.

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:12.810
Kamonegi!
Shadow Clones!

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:17.190
Riolu! Strike <i>all</i> the clones
with Vacuum Wave!

00:04:23.760 --> 00:04:25.030
Impressive, Riolu!

00:04:25.030 --> 00:04:27.770
Okay! I think it’s time we...

00:04:29.400 --> 00:04:30.960
You still wanna go on?

00:04:38.430 --> 00:04:39.800
Spear!
Turning Swallow Strike!

00:04:48.230 --> 00:04:49.970
You gotta be tired
by now, yeah?

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:58.730
That’s it for today’s training!

00:04:58.730 --> 00:05:00.090
Pikachu, sorry I kept you...

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:08.830
Pikachu... You’re asleep?

00:05:09.710 --> 00:05:11.810
Oh, come on...

00:05:11.810 --> 00:05:14.830
Riolu was working so hard.

00:05:15.610 --> 00:05:18.690
I can’t send you out in official battles
if you act like this.

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:23.880
What are you doing?!

00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:27.880
Same as ever, I see.

00:05:27.880 --> 00:05:28.640
Mom?

00:05:29.870 --> 00:05:31.510
What brings you here?

00:05:31.880 --> 00:05:35.200
One of my friends
lives near the laboratory.

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:37.530
She said she was going home,
so I came along.

00:05:37.530 --> 00:05:40.650
I thought I might drop by for a visit.

00:05:43.120 --> 00:05:45.440
I haven’t had Mom’s cooking
in a while!

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:50.870
Go, Koharu, you eat up, too!

00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:51.880
Sure!

00:05:51.880 --> 00:05:55.250
Perfect timing!
Mom’s out with Sota today.

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:58.600
I feel bad for having you
make so much.

00:05:58.600 --> 00:06:02.490
Oh, it was nothing. You’ve been taking
such good care of Satoshi for me!

00:06:02.490 --> 00:06:06.970
We’re happy to have him here!
Would you like to stay the night with us?

00:06:06.970 --> 00:06:08.840
What? May I?

00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:12.350
Of course!
We have a guest room.

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:14.590
I suppose I’ll take you
up on that, then.

00:06:14.590 --> 00:06:16.450
Dinner time!

00:06:17.730 --> 00:06:19.990
Hey, Satoshi!

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:22.790
Ah, I’m stuffed...

00:06:22.790 --> 00:06:24.410
Thanks for the food.

00:06:24.410 --> 00:06:25.870
It was delicious!

00:06:26.640 --> 00:06:28.530
You guys done, too?

00:06:30.930 --> 00:06:33.230
Huh? You <i>still</i> wanna train?

00:06:35.150 --> 00:06:35.930
Oh, you!

00:06:35.930 --> 00:06:39.080
You hate losing
just as much as I do!

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:41.380
Okay! Let’s work off the meal, then!

00:06:42.630 --> 00:06:47.490
Satoshi is really fired up for his
Pokémon World Championships matches.

00:06:47.490 --> 00:06:49.130
<i>Too</i> fired up, if you ask me.

00:06:49.750 --> 00:06:52.020
Oh, that’s just like him.

00:06:52.020 --> 00:06:53.670
Right, Pika-chan?

00:06:55.890 --> 00:06:58.660
I think Pikachu might be jealous.

00:07:00.070 --> 00:07:03.390
Wanpachi went through the same
not too long ago.

00:07:05.910 --> 00:07:07.030
Pika-chan.

00:07:10.620 --> 00:07:12.280
Pika-chan.

00:07:13.020 --> 00:07:15.790
You’re special to Satoshi.

00:07:16.710 --> 00:07:20.090
You’ve been with him ever since
the day he left home, after all!

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:26.670
Oh, come to think of it,
how did Satoshi and Pikachu meet?

00:07:27.080 --> 00:07:31.900
On his tenth birthday, the day he was
supposed to get his first Pokémon,

00:07:31.900 --> 00:07:34.260
he went and overslept.

00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:36.760
Pika-chan was the only one left.

00:07:37.560 --> 00:07:41.640
I hear it took a while for Pika-chan
to warm up to him.

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:43.420
I see.

00:07:43.420 --> 00:07:45.740
I guess everybody
has their issues...

00:07:45.740 --> 00:07:46.690
Right?

00:07:47.140 --> 00:07:48.880
Now, Ma’am...

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:50.680
You must be tired.

00:07:50.680 --> 00:07:54.320
We’ll clean up here,
so you can take it easy.

00:07:54.320 --> 00:07:57.880
Barrierd, can you show her
to the guest room?

00:07:59.490 --> 00:08:01.420
If you’ll excuse me, then...

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:08.250
Oh, you too, Pika-chan?

00:08:12.930 --> 00:08:15.640
It’s just about bedtime.

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:17.470
You’ve done great, Bari-chan.

00:08:18.210 --> 00:08:21.830
Oh, and thank you for
always looking after everyone!

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:24.480
All right, Pika-chan.

00:08:25.410 --> 00:08:27.980
You should go back to
Satoshi and Go’s room.

00:08:36.260 --> 00:08:37.200
Pika-chan?

00:08:42.730 --> 00:08:43.710
Pika-chan...

00:08:44.940 --> 00:08:47.090
Satoshi will be lonely.

00:08:51.650 --> 00:08:53.180
You’re like a baby.

00:08:53.950 --> 00:08:58.430
Satoshi used to sleep in my bed all the time
when he was younger.

00:09:00.470 --> 00:09:06.720
Sleep tight...

00:09:08.310 --> 00:09:16.400
In Mommy’s arms...

00:09:19.140 --> 00:09:27.980
Together with the new breeze...

00:09:55.090 --> 00:09:56.650
Thank you for having me.

00:09:56.650 --> 00:09:59.410
You’re welcome.
Come visit again whenever you like.

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:01.590
See you, Go.

00:10:01.590 --> 00:10:02.600
Yes!

00:10:02.600 --> 00:10:06.150
Satoshi, remember to do
as the Director says.

00:10:06.150 --> 00:10:07.780
I know!

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:11.400
Oh, Pika-chan.

00:10:13.110 --> 00:10:14.630
Hang in there!

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:17.430
See you, Rio-chan!

00:10:19.600 --> 00:10:22.550
Bari-chan,
look after everyone for me!

00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:36.200
Go, there’s some data
I’d like your help with.

00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:37.620
Okay.

00:10:37.620 --> 00:10:40.230
Riolu, let’s get back to training!

00:10:43.900 --> 00:10:45.770
I’ll train with you later.

00:10:46.670 --> 00:10:48.710
Wait for your turn!

00:11:09.770 --> 00:11:10.470
PocketMonsters

00:11:10.470 --> 00:11:12.130
Pocket Monsters!
PocketMonsters

00:11:12.130 --> 00:11:16.570
PocketMonsters

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:21.490
.   Fairy   .
.Psychic.
Barrierd
PocketMonsters

00:13:23.750 --> 00:13:25.860
Can you give me a ride
to Kuchiba City?

00:13:25.860 --> 00:13:28.450
Sure can! Hop on!

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:29.870
Thank you so much!

00:14:05.820 --> 00:14:09.670
What’s that? Y’all hitchhiking?
Ya want a ride?

00:14:11.800 --> 00:14:13.580
Yeah, I gotcha.

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:17.080
Y’all wanna go this way, yeah?
Sure, hop right on!

00:14:42.260 --> 00:14:46.760
I’m gon’ turn right now.
Y’all good with that?

00:14:48.280 --> 00:14:50.060
Okay!

00:15:18.980 --> 00:15:21.040
What’s that?
Y’all gettin’ off?

00:15:21.640 --> 00:15:25.230
I gotcha.
Yer nearly there, huh?

00:15:30.600 --> 00:15:32.640
Take care, now!

00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:38.800
Pikachu!

00:18:45.120 --> 00:18:47.430
I thought I’d find you here!

00:18:50.620 --> 00:18:53.650
I’m sorry I made you
feel lonely, Pikachu.

00:18:54.550 --> 00:18:56.560
Koharu really let me have it, too.

00:18:56.560 --> 00:18:59.660
She said I didn’t understand
how you felt at all.

00:19:00.680 --> 00:19:02.150
It was all my fault.

00:19:03.560 --> 00:19:04.560
Sorry.

00:19:22.330 --> 00:19:24.030
Why...?

00:19:29.030 --> 00:19:32.730
Geez! Do you know how worried
we were, Pika-chan?!

00:19:34.090 --> 00:19:35.270
Bad!

00:19:36.170 --> 00:19:38.680
Now let’s eat.

00:19:38.680 --> 00:19:40.530
You must be hungry.

00:19:42.240 --> 00:19:45.990
I really appreciate you all
keeping Satoshi company.

00:19:45.990 --> 00:19:47.610
You can sleep here tonight.

00:19:47.610 --> 00:19:48.650
Thank you!

00:19:48.650 --> 00:19:51.490
And don’t worry,
I’ll look after Satoshi!

00:19:51.490 --> 00:19:53.150
I’m glad to hear it!

00:19:53.150 --> 00:19:54.210
Time to...

00:19:55.630 --> 00:19:58.070
Hey, Satoshi!

00:19:58.070 --> 00:20:00.110
Pika-chan, you too?!

00:20:03.080 --> 00:20:06.550
I’d better thank Barrierd
again tomorrow.

00:20:08.050 --> 00:20:10.860
You’re tired, right?
Guess we’d better go to sleep.

00:20:20.540 --> 00:20:28.350
Sleep tight...

00:20:30.110 --> 00:20:39.490
In Mommy’s arms...

00:20:40.930 --> 00:20:45.410
You know the lullaby
Mom used to sing for me, too?

00:20:49.290 --> 00:20:56.810
Together with the new breeze...

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:33.900
We don’t know if Pokémon dream.

00:21:34.700 --> 00:21:38.760
But let’s hope that tomorrow,
the day after, and even beyond that,

00:21:38.760 --> 00:21:43.790
when they wake up, they’ll be with
the one they love the most.

