00:23:09.640 --> 00:23:10.860
Go!

00:23:11.760 --> 00:23:15.050
Koharu says one of Sota’s friends
is having some trouble.

00:23:15.050 --> 00:23:16.310
Oh, it’s a Hinbass!

00:23:16.310 --> 00:23:19.080
Yeah. She’s having trouble
with that Hinbass.

00:23:19.080 --> 00:23:21.520
Battling trouble?
Is it gonna battle?!

00:23:21.520 --> 00:23:25.290
No. She’s not sure how to show
how great Hinbass is...

00:23:25.290 --> 00:23:28.470
That’s the perfect reason
to battle, though!

00:23:28.470 --> 00:23:29.750
Oh, be quiet.

